>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. APPOINTMENT-RECURRENCE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "appointment-status.cpy".
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 LS-YEAR                PIC 9(4).
01 LS-MONTH               PIC 9(2).
01 LS-DAY                 PIC 9(2).
01 LS-CANDIDATE           PIC 9(8).
01 LS-STATUS              PIC 9(3).
01 LS-DATE-OP             PIC X(12).
LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "appointment-date-params.cpy".
01 LK-STATUS              PIC 9(3).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS LK-STATUS.
    MOVE APPT-OK TO LK-STATUS
    MOVE ADP-INPUT-DATE(1:4) TO LS-YEAR
    MOVE ADP-INPUT-DATE(5:2) TO LS-MONTH
    MOVE ADP-INPUT-DATE(7:2) TO LS-DAY
    IF ADP-ANCHOR-DAY > 0 MOVE ADP-ANCHOR-DAY TO LS-DAY END-IF
    EVALUATE ADP-RECURRENCE
      WHEN "W"
        MOVE "ADD-DAYS" TO LS-DATE-OP
        MOVE 7 TO ADP-DAY-NUMBER
        CALL "APPOINTMENT-DATES" USING LS-DATE-OP
          APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS LK-STATUS
      WHEN "B"
        MOVE "ADD-DAYS" TO LS-DATE-OP
        MOVE 14 TO ADP-DAY-NUMBER
        CALL "APPOINTMENT-DATES" USING LS-DATE-OP
          APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS LK-STATUS
      WHEN "M"
        ADD 1 TO LS-MONTH
        IF LS-MONTH > 12 MOVE 1 TO LS-MONTH ADD 1 TO LS-YEAR END-IF
        PERFORM BUILD-CLAMPED-DATE
      WHEN "Y"
        ADD 1 TO LS-YEAR
        PERFORM BUILD-CLAMPED-DATE
      WHEN OTHER
        MOVE APPT-INVALID-REQUEST TO LK-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.
BUILD-CLAMPED-DATE.
    MOVE LS-YEAR TO LS-CANDIDATE(1:4)
    MOVE LS-MONTH TO LS-CANDIDATE(5:2)
    MOVE LS-DAY TO LS-CANDIDATE(7:2)
    PERFORM UNTIL FUNCTION TEST-DATE-YYYYMMDD(LS-CANDIDATE) = 0
      SUBTRACT 1 FROM LS-DAY
      MOVE LS-DAY TO LS-CANDIDATE(7:2)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE LS-CANDIDATE TO ADP-OUTPUT-DATE.
END PROGRAM APPOINTMENT-RECURRENCE.
